#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:4
msgid "Price Sets"
msgstr "Precio Sets"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:6
msgid ""
"Price Sets combine Prices and then attach to Plans. Prices must be created "
"prior to creating Price Sets, but it is recommended to review the Price Set "
"Type options prior to creating Prices."
msgstr ""
"Precio Sets combine Precios y then attach a Planes. Precios debe ser creado "
"prior a creando Precio Sets, pero ello es recomendado a review el Precio "
"Establecido Tipo opciones prior a creando Precios."

