#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:115
msgid "Cost"
msgstr "Cost"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:115
msgid ""
"The base cost of the resource(s). The Price will match the Cost unless a "
"Price Adjustment is added."
msgstr ""
"El base cost de el recurso(s). El Precio va a match el Cost unless a Precio "
"Adjustment es agregado."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:121
msgid "Price Adjustment"
msgstr "Precio Adjustment"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:118
msgid "**None:** Default, no markup added and Price will match Cost"
msgstr "**None:** Predeterminado, no markup agregado y Precio va a match Cost"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:119
msgid ""
"**Fixed Markup:** A fixed amount added to the Cost. Price will equal Cost + "
"Markup."
msgstr ""
"**Fixed Markup:** Un fixed amount agregado a el Cost. Precio va a equal Cost"
" + Markup."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:120
msgid ""
"**Percentage Markup:** Adds a percentage markup to Cost. Price equals `Cost "
"+ (Cost x Markup %)`"
msgstr ""
"**Percentage Markup:** Adds a percentage markup a Cost. Precio equals `Cost "
"+ (Cost x Markup %)`"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:121
msgid ""
"**Custom Price:** Sets a Price independent from the Cost. If the Cost "
"changes, a Custom Price will not."
msgstr ""
"**Personalizado Precio:** Sets a Precio independent desde el Cost. Si el "
"Cost changes, a Personalizado Precio no."

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:124
msgid "Price"
msgstr "Precio"

#: ../../administration/plans_pricing/prices.rst:124
msgid ""
"A computed value of the final price including the cost plus any applicable "
"markup."
msgstr ""
"Un computed valor de el final precio incluyendo el cost plus cualquier "
"applicable markup."
